# Drop your images here, then point the matching content/*.ts entry at them.
#
# Suggested files (filenames are up to you — just match them in the content data):
#   portrait.jpg               -> content/profile.ts  (set `portrait: "/img/portrait.jpg"`)
#   larry.png                  -> content/projects.ts (set the Larry entry's `image`)
#   remand.png
#   under-the-campanile.png
#   sauna-os.png
#   contrabot.png
#
# Until a file exists and its path is set, the site shows a labelled placeholder box.
